<title>FRANCE: French premier Jospin will not attend NATO summit.</title>
<headline>French premier Jospin will not attend NATO summit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Socialist Prime Minister Lionel Jospin will not attend the NATO summit in Madrid on July 8 and 9, his office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They gave no reason for the decision.</p>
<p>Conservative President Jacques Chirac will represent France at the meeting, which will focus on inviting some Eastern European countries to join the alliance.</p>
</text>
